  {
   "id": "shattered-tale-of-the-forgotten-king-25555@0.12",
   "gameId": "shattered-tale-of-the-forgotten-king-25555",
   "displayName": "Hotfix 0.12",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-11-03T16:39:12.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey again dear Wanderers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you so much for your quick feedback and positive comments on the last update, we're so glad you liked it ♥",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've been able to make a little hotfix, since a few problematic bugs had shown up.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Here it is",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "• Fix of the crashes that happened when fighting the Stranger and Gheb",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fix of display bugs in the binding menu",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fix of the freeze that happened when you used a Mark from the inventory",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• The casting bar of the Marks no longer stays on the screen afterwards",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Loot still appears even if you hide the HUD",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fix of the link between Limbo and the door of Khotar",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Legionaries now have a thrust attack with a wider dash, and gained a few adjustments on their AI",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Damage reduction for the charged attacks, light and heavy",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• The door of Khotar can't be skipped anymore",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• We also made a few display corrections on certain maps.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As always, we're all ears for your feedback!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "See you soon, Wanderers!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
